-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope

This licence covers the original work in this repository: the Firebrand kext
(kext/), Firebrand's OS layer and its own parts of the hardware library
(shared/, amdgpu/), HDAudio (kexts/HDAudio/), the build and install scripts,
the tools, and the Firebrand artwork (art/).

Much of the hardware library is ported from other projects. Those parts keep
their own copyright notices, which stay at the top of each file, and their own
licences, all MIT-style like this one:

  - Code ported from Linux's amdgpu, powerplay and radeon drivers, and AMD's
    register, AtomBIOS and SMU headers (amdgpu/, amdgpu/include/,
    shared/atom/): MIT, Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. and the other holders
    each file names. LICENSES/MIT-amdgpu.txt has the notice.
  - Code from RadeonNI-OSX (radeonni/, and the Firebrand files whose headers
    name it): MIT, radeonni/LICENSE.
  - radeonni/mesa/patches/: changes to Mesa, under the licence of the Mesa
    files they change (MIT). LICENSES/MIT-Mesa.txt has Mesa's notice.

Not covered, and not in this repository:
  - AMD's GPU microcode. scripts/fetch-firmware.sh downloads it from
    linux-firmware and the build embeds it in Firebrand.kext. It is AMD's,
    redistributable in binary form under LICENSES/LICENSE.amdgpu.
  - Noto Sans, the typeface of the Firebrand wordmark: SIL Open Font
    License 1.1, art/OFL-NotoSans.txt.

NOTICE lists every third-party component and its licence.
